<title>ITALY: Bank of Italy sets 3.0 trillion lire repo tender.</title>
<headline>Bank of Italy sets 3.0 trillion lire repo tender.</headline>
<dateline>ROME 1996-09-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Bank of Italy said it called a 3.0 trillion lire repurchase tender for September 12 for government securities to be resold by September 19.</p>
<p>At the previous comparable operation for 5.5 trillion lire on September 9, the minimum accepted rate stood at 8.56 percent and the average rate at 8.57 percent.</p>
</text>
